{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4C-DrS4afcTUp2abEq_Asg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:50.240917+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4C-DrS4afcTUp2abEq_Asg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5uBTZYOYkkFTU0tTEtzL3iaHa9rT4H2icNpoiaqjkrQhUpro6xaibficjXxAd7FD0KpsIQ5Sp2Wia3oo1VskH1fPDdSQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJ8OA28Dyg1UrbY5rMoMxUq32u2HRm79v0juLpqJpOKWBJ1iaXg0TAvTw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5uBTZYOYkkFTU0tTEtzL3iaHa9rT4H2icNOWH2bWGaKhsq3QEhfRv3s4nfDRkn9qHicNXnZDTAUdVf0RbXK2CfVGQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJwVNjo3kUo2Y7mSl6rZJGfgZB7AiczHPuqWgKxudofdpxrZibMttlibEKA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>哈尔滨工程大学水声工程学院</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2025年优秀大学生</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>暑期夏令营活动</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5uBTZYOYkkFTU0tTEtzL3iaHa9rT4H2icNdoNNLX1Z95QREo0CNibFicl7GfLds1e7wATLCJSvhs8nCLKeXboibxgKg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5uBTZYOYkkFTU0tTEtzL3iaHa9rT4H2icNyHYxvTXeggwxBIkBZyMCuRhe3TiaRqxaiaVZ5ictNSSEwajqSGjyoMoJQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5uBTZYOYkkFTU0tTEtzL3iaHa9rT4H2icNv44fU3N1lAF4W18zvbJPAI3maQqUBNlEXBJCyw1uFicYVQ2gtHFPo7A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>哈尔滨工程大学水声工程学院源于1953年建立的我国第一个声纳专业——中国人民解放军军事工程学院（哈军工）海军工程系声纳专业，是改革开放后首批硕士、博士、博士后人才培养单位。经过几代人的不懈奋斗，目前已发展成为国内规模最大、学科方向最齐全、师资力量最雄厚的水声人才培养基地，是我国高水平水声技术人才的</span></span><span>培养摇篮和水声技术新理论、新技术、新方法的创新源头，是哈尔滨工程大学“三海一核”办学特色最具代表性的学科、专业和教学科研机构之一。学院水声工程学科是首批国家重点学科，在教育部历次学科评估中均名列第一；水声工程学科所在的一级学科——船舶与海洋工程在教育部一级学科评估中获得A+。</span></p><p><span>水声工程学院拟于2025年8月中下旬举办“2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动”活动。该夏令营通过讲座、参观和交流等多种形式，帮助有志于投身水声领域科学研究的本科三年级学生了解水声工程学科发展前沿与我院科研现状，感受研究生生活，了解学院关于研究生培养的相关政策。欢迎广大优秀学子踊跃报名参加我院大学生暑期夏令营活动！</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJTGlVtuf1RlnhlLqNWkHT7pQ11JloLOpRmrczjYOfibjXalHTiclG7wvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJTGlVtuf1RlnhlLqNWkHT7pQ11JloLOpRmrczjYOfibjXalHTiclG7wvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、 拥护中国共产党、热爱祖国、思想品德优良、遵纪守法、身心健康，无违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、 具备较高的科研学术素养，对所报学科专业学术研究有浓厚兴趣，有志于从事水声工程领域相关研究。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3、 全国高校具有船舶与海洋工程、水声工程、信息与通信工程、物理学、数学、海洋科学、计算机、人工智能、电子信息等相关理工科专业背景的2026届本科生。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4、 本科学习成绩优秀，英语水平良好，能够预计获得所在学校2026年推荐免试研究生资格且意向报考我院研究生者优先。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJTGlVtuf1RlnhlLqNWkHT7pQ11JloLOpRmrczjYOfibjXalHTiclG7wvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请材料及程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJTGlVtuf1RlnhlLqNWkHT7pQ11JloLOpRmrczjYOfibjXalHTiclG7wvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、 2025年哈尔滨工程大学水声工程学院优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表1份（附件1）并扫码填写问卷报名：</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ay3YiaNcZDwF5ZcSJlUqG6NazyelSmlN7L7DEOYcR0EqJBQzufufrY3J1JqnEdmfCQKSAib8853icMgM8f9gZuYcw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、 身份证和学生证。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3、 本科成绩单（需加盖所在学校或学院教务部门公章）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4、 本科前三学年（或前五学期）学习成绩专业排名证明（需加盖所在学校或学院教务部门公章）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>5、 英语CET4/CET6或新TOEFL/IELTS成绩单。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>6、 其他能够证明个人能力的材料（包括：获奖证书，发表或者能体现自身学术水平的学术论文、出版物等）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>备注：上述材料申请表以单独PDF文档提交（以姓名+夏令营申请表命名），其他2、3、4、5、6申请材料电子版请按照编号顺序，形成一个PDF文档（以姓名+夏令营材料命名）提交。</span></p><p><span>申请者将2个PDF文档汇总至一个文件夹（以姓名命名），压缩后发送至邮箱chensheng@hrbeu.edu.cn，邮件主题栏需标注“姓名+暑假夏令营申请”字样。所有申请者于2025年7月21日12:00前提交全部申请材料，逾期不再受理。</span></p><p><span>完成上述步骤后，请加入“水声工程学院2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营”群聊。QQ群号：1045793327。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJTGlVtuf1RlnhlLqNWkHT7pQ11JloLOpRmrczjYOfibjXalHTiclG7wvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJTGlVtuf1RlnhlLqNWkHT7pQ11JloLOpRmrczjYOfibjXalHTiclG7wvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、 本次夏令营拟于8月中下旬开展，预计招收学员30人左右。具体时间向报名成功学生再通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、 活动内容包括开营典礼、学院及教学科研团队介绍、导师与营员座谈交流、学术讲座、参观实验室、闭营仪式等。具体日常后续通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJTGlVtuf1RlnhlLqNWkHT7pQ11JloLOpRmrczjYOfibjXalHTiclG7wvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、保障政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJTGlVtuf1RlnhlLqNWkHT7pQ11JloLOpRmrczjYOfibjXalHTiclG7wvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营不收取报名费、营费及相关资料费，水声工程学院将统一安排夏令营活动期间在哈食宿（哈尔滨高校的学员不提供住宿）。</span></p><p><span>最终报考水声工程学院相关专业并被录取的非哈尔滨市营员往返哈尔滨的火车票费用（按硬卧、高铁二等座、动车二等座标准，需提供原始票据，选择其他交通工具，超出规定部分需自行承担）由水声工程学院承担。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJTGlVtuf1RlnhlLqNWkHT7pQ11JloLOpRmrczjYOfibjXalHTiclG7wvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>五、联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkZfbGviajGotr8uDruHGvtpJ1DZmnxibJTGlVtuf1RlnhlLqNWkHT7pQ11JloLOpRmrczjYOfibjXalHTiclG7wvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>通讯地址：哈尔滨工程大学水声工程学院研究生培养办（水声楼302室）</span></p><p><span>联系人：李杨、陈胜</span></p><p><span>咨询电话：0451-82519500</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4C-DrS4afcTUp2abEq_Asg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：水声工程学院2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表.doc</a></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/ay3YiaNcZDwF5ZcSJlUqG6NazyelSmlN7gO2fQSl9H55PUuoAQBtTaicibWbhiay1o7W2PFgTqFYKn5Zqp2yclok3g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>图文 | 陈   胜</span></p><p><span>排版 | 张沛然</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 王   昊</span></p><p><span><span>审核 | 张海刚</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>水声工程学院宣</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"9b80ee137c225954516bf4729f3c80848535e86db6269e13102b429cf427a0be","textLength":1576,"sourceSha256":"88634d26872c240f646b30ef678e970f0234d15236edc4b6e6aeb65e45c69c50","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0ad24884929fb4470840","title":"2025年哈尔滨工程大学水声工程学院2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:50.240917+00:00"}
